WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.068
Stremio is an optional, separate player.

00:00:03.068 --> 00:00:09.203
TT tv can show your Stremio library and open a title there.

00:00:09.203 --> 00:00:13.805
Your TV provider continues to handle your live channels.

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:20.360
Use Downloader to open the official Stremio downloads page linked in the guide.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:25.157
Select Android TV and the ARM package for your device.

00:00:25.157 --> 00:00:27.555
Install Stremio and sign in.

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:32.971
In TT tv, open My Library and choose Sign in to Stremio.

00:00:32.971 --> 00:00:37.217
On your phone, open the link shown on your television.

00:00:37.217 --> 00:00:41.888
Sign in with the same account and enter the four-character code.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:46.401
Choose a Stremio film or episode in TT tv.

00:00:46.401 --> 00:00:52.457
Select Watch on Stremio and choose an available source in the Stremio player.

00:00:52.457 --> 00:00:58.513
Use Sync now in TT tv's Stremio account settings to refresh your library.

00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:03.711
Torrentio is a third-party Stremio add-on for finding torrent sources.

00:01:03.711 --> 00:01:07.126
Use sources you have permission to access.

00:01:07.126 --> 00:01:14.930
On a computer, use the configuration link in the guide to choose your language and resolution.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.429
Real-Debrid is an optional paid service.

00:01:18.429 --> 00:01:23.727
If you use it, choose RealDebrid in the add-on configuration.

00:01:23.727 --> 00:01:29.555
Treat your private key and the generated installation link like passwords.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:34.666
Choose Install in the configurator, then confirm in Stremio.

00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:39.458
Reopen Stremio on your TV with the same account.

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:45.847
TT tv's guide, channels and provider library also work without these add-ons.

